
```mermaid
graph LR
    %% Voice Input
    VoiceNote[Voice Note] -->|Telegram| SarvamSTT[Sarvam STT]
    TypedMessage[Typed Message] -->|Telegram| DirectInput[Direct Input]

    %% Processing
    SarvamSTT -->|Transcript| Transcript[transcript]
    DirectInput -->|Text| DirectInput

    %% Unified Processing
    Transcript -->|Same turn| SteadProcessor[Stead Processor]
    DirectInput -->|Same turn| SteadProcessor

    %% Output Paths
    SteadProcessor -->|Text response| TextOutput[Text Output]
    SteadProcessor -->|Voice response| EdgeTTS[Edge TTS]
    EdgeTTS -->|Voice output| VoiceOutput[Voice Note]

    %% Styling
    classDef input fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    classDef process fill:#bbf,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    classDef output fill:#bfb,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px

    class VoiceNote,TypedMessage input
    class SarvamSTT,DirectInput,Transcript,SteadProcessor process
    class TextOutput,VoiceOutput output
```
